# Local-only: pnpm 11 writes its build allowlist here (pnpm approve-builds).
# It MUST NOT be committed - CI builds with pnpm 9, which treats any
# pnpm-workspace.yaml as a monorepo and then fails. pnpm 9 reads the allowlist
# from the "pnpm" field in package.json instead.
